SoftQP native engine

Contains modified OSQP and OSQP Python interface (Apache-2.0).
OSQP contributors: https://github.com/osqp/osqp
Generalized penalty implementation: A2R-Lab/osqp at 2500405a1bc63387721feec64f0c050fa99223dd.
Python binding: A2R-Lab/osqp-python at d6df7f987ba40e75bfac338ab19a97b2c92f7334.
OSQPSlack research repository: https://github.com/A2R-Lab/OSQPSlack (MIT).
Original notices and licenses are retained under native/.
The namespace and reproducible local-source build are modified for SoftQP.

SoftQP modifications include asymmetric projection, objective, conjugate, scaling
and recession paths, original-space contracts, compact/asymmetric lifting adapters
and the optional original-scale DAQP comparison. Modified files are marked.
